#: data/world/years.json
msgid "A 2040 vehicle transition plan changes energy and transport demand."
msgstr "2040 車輛轉型政策改變能源與運輸需求。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A 30% advance on $1,000 brings $300 now and leaves $700 to collect later. It helps fund stock without increasing total revenue."
msgstr "$1,000 合約預付 30%，現在收到 $300，之後再收 $700；能幫忙進貨，但總營收沒有增加。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A Day Pass ($15) lets you use the hot desks and their computers today. A monthly desk is cheaper if you come often."
msgstr "日票（$15）今天可以使用共享座位和電腦。常來的話，月租座位比較划算。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A Van Driver (People tab) takes one run each workday from 9:00. Your own ecommerce parcels can go out in the van too: choose \"Own van\" at the packing table."
msgstr "貨車司機（人員分頁）每個工作日 9:00 起接一趟外送。你自己的電商包裹也能用貨車送：在打包桌選「自己的貨車」。"

#: autoload/save_system.gd:133 autoload/save_system.gd:408 scripts/ui/modals/save_list_modal.gd:63
msgid "A backup could not be created. Your existing save is unchanged."
msgstr "無法建立備份。原有存檔仍完整保留。"

#: data/jobs/bank_teller.json
msgid "A bakery owner asks for a loan. Sofia asks for three months of books. You see why."
msgstr "一位麵包店老闆來申請貸款，Sofia 要他拿出三個月的帳本。你懂為什麼了。"

#: data/dialogue/okafor_intro.json
msgid "A bakery, then a phone repair shop, then a café that opened too late in the morning. Old Town walks to work early."
msgstr "先是麵包店，後來是手機維修店，再來是一家咖啡店，可惜早上開得太晚。舊城區的人很早就出門上班。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A bank transfer across borders through a chain of banks. Each one checks it, so it takes days."
msgstr "跨國銀行轉帳，要經過好幾家銀行，每一家都會審核，所以要好幾天。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A barista's manager reviews your service and cleaning; higher ratings unlock the next rank."
msgstr "咖啡師的主管會評估你的服務和清潔，評價越高越快升級。"

#: data/properties/pier7_warehouse.json
msgid "A bay on Pier 7 with a loading dock, pallet racking and a packing bench. Once it is yours, your stock can be delivered here and orders packed on the spot. The rent is due whether the racking is full or not."
msgstr "7 號碼頭上的一個倉位，有裝卸平台、棧板貨架和打包檯。租下來後，你的庫存可以直接送到這裡，訂單也能就地打包。貨架滿不滿，租金都照付。"

#: data/story/achievements.json
msgid "A better deal"
msgstr "談成好條件"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "A better price, a longer handshake. A year to earn the rest."
msgstr "價格更好，握手更久。剩下的一年後再賺。"

#: scripts/sim/assistant_policy.gd:152
msgid "A bill is past its due date. A small late fee was added; pay it from Finance when you can."
msgstr "有一張帳單過了繳費期限，已加收少許逾期費。方便時到「財務」繳清即可。"

#: scripts/sim/fundraising.gd:685
msgid "A board review is ready. Choose your next step in Reports."
msgstr "董事會審查已備妥，可到報告選擇下一步。"

#: data/dialogue/ruiz_intro.json
msgid "A building permit comes before construction. Choose your scale, fund the monthly milestones and allow for delays and material overruns."
msgstr "動工前先取得建照，選擇規模並準備每月工程款，也要預留延誤及建材超支。"

#: scripts/frontend/main_menu.gd:38
msgid "A business-simulation RPG in a living, modern city."
msgstr "一款在鮮活的現代城市裡經營事業的模擬 RPG。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A busy counter can still lose money when staffing costs exceed customer receipts."
msgstr "人潮多也可能虧錢；員工成本超過顧客付款時，就得調整排班。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A busy sales day raises receivables before checking cash. Keep enough cash for bills until the payout."
msgstr "熱賣的一天會先增加應收款，銀行現金不會立即增加；撥款前仍要準備繳帳單的現金。"

#: data/events/automotive_flood.json
msgid "A buyer may find the damage later: a refund claim and a consumer fine are likely."
msgstr "買家之後可能發現損壞：很可能被求償退款並遭消費者保護罰款。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A buyer usually pays a multiple of yearly profit, plus the company's cash and stock, minus what it owes."
msgstr "買家通常會付年獲利的幾倍，再加上公司的現金和庫存，扣掉公司欠的錢。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/clerk_forms_game.gd:67
msgid "A caller complains about a delayed application. Verify the reference, explain the status, and escalate unresolved cases."
msgstr "來電客人抱怨申請延誤，請核對案號、說明進度，並轉交尚未解決的問題。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A campaign aims for relevant reach or conversions, then reports actual measured results."
msgstr "活動以有效觸及或轉換為目標，並回報實際測量結果。"

#: scripts/sim/fundraising.gd:743
msgid "A campaign is already running. Wait for its result."
msgstr "已有一場募資正在進行，請等待結果。"

#: data/events/media_pr.json
msgid "A campaign message upset its audience. Repair it at a cost or keep spending with weaker creative."
msgstr "活動訊息引起客群不滿。可付費修復，或以較差的創意繼續投放。"

#: scripts/world/car.gd:114
msgid "A car brushed past you. Cross at a green crosswalk."
msgstr "有車從你身邊擦過。請走綠燈斑馬線。"

#: data/story/achievements.json
msgid "A change of owner"
msgstr "換一位主人"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:244
msgid "A change of ownership"
msgstr "公司換了主人"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A charge per parcel padded with plastic, under the Clean Packaging Act (Year 4)."
msgstr "第 4 年《清潔包裝法》上路後，用塑膠緩衝材的包裹每件都要繳的費用。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A cheap car sitting idle earns nothing; a high price loses requests. Service skipped means breakdowns and bad reviews."
msgstr "便宜的車閒著也賺不到錢；價格太高會流失詢問。不保養就會拋錨並得到負評。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A cheaper home lowers the rent actually paid, but the route to your job and business takes more travel time. Studio 1A holds 200 units; Riverside holds 600."
msgstr "便宜的住處能省下實際房租，但到工作地點與商業區需要更多通勤時間。1A 套房可放 200 件，河濱住處可放 600 件。"

#: data/story/personal/maya.json
msgid "A checked guide with contacts and clear limits"
msgstr "經查核的指南、聯絡方式與明確限制"

#: data/story/personal/sam.json
msgid "A checked handover pack with inspection exceptions"
msgstr "經查核的交車文件與尚待檢查項目"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A client posts a job with several stops, a fee and a deadline. On time pays the full fee, late pays less, and a run left undone is cancelled."
msgstr "客戶會刊登一張外送單：幾個停靠點、一筆運費和一個截止時間。準時送到拿全額，遲到拿得比較少，放著沒送的單會被取消。"

#: data/legacy.json
msgid "A closed company did not close the rest of your life."
msgstr "一家公司結束，並不代表你的人生也結束。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A closed originating business retires its requests. Completed or expired work cannot pay twice."
msgstr "原公司關閉後，其請求也會結束。已完成或逾期的工作不能重複收款。"

#: data/story/achievements.json
msgid "A colleague"
msgstr "第一位夥伴"

#: scripts/sim/fundraising.gd:735
msgid "A community round needs an operating company with customers to appeal to."
msgstr "社群募資需要一家有客戶的營運中公司。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/fundraising_modal.gd:403
msgid "A community round sells small equity stakes to customers and fans for an all-or-nothing goal. The promotion is a real cost; if the goal is missed every pledge is returned and nothing is raised."
msgstr "社群募資向客戶與粉絲出售小額股權，採全有或全無制。宣傳是真實成本；沒達標時所有認購款全數退回，也募不到任何錢。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/insolvency_modal.gd:74
msgid "A company can fail. You don't."
msgstr "公司可以失敗，你不會。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/insolvency_modal.gd:30
msgid "A company can fail. You don't. Pick what happens next:"
msgstr "公司可以失敗，你不會。選擇接下來怎麼做："

#: data/story/achievements.json
msgid "A company of your own"
msgstr "自己的公司"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A completed attempt never settles twice. Continuing preserves your city and assets. Start a new game to try another scenario."
msgstr "已完成的挑戰不會重複結算。繼續生活會保留城市與資產；想嘗試其他情境，可另開新遊戲。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:304
msgid "A contract offer is waiting in Contracts."
msgstr "「合約」裡有一份報價在等你。"

#: data/events/fitness_carrier.json
msgid "A courier introduction"
msgstr "物流商介紹"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A dealership needs a deposit, a showroom and a minimum number of new cars in stock or on order each month."
msgstr "經銷權需要保證金、展示中心，且每月庫存或在途新車不得低於最低量。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A deductible and policy limit leave real downside. Claims are receivables until paid; fines, ordinary investment and hypothetical lost sales are not insured."
msgstr "自負額和保單上限仍會留下損失風險。核准理賠先列應收款，實際收到才入現金；罰款、一般投資及假設的營收損失不承保。"

#: data/economy/fundraising.json
msgid "A department-store group that gives shelf space to a single local brand at a time."
msgstr "百貨集團，一次只給一個本地品牌櫃位。"

#: data/economy/fundraising.json
msgid "A design studio that co-brands limited runs with local companies."
msgstr "設計工作室，與本地公司推出限量聯名商品。"

#: data/economy/staff.json
msgid "A designer and media buyer unlock three simultaneous client campaigns."
msgstr "設計師和媒體採購員可讓你同時執行三場客戶活動。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A distributor owns the customers; a warehouse fulfils orders for your customers."
msgstr "經銷商的客戶歸他；海外倉是替你服務你的客戶。"

#: data/story/goals.json
msgid "A diversified business"
msgstr "多元經營"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A fast route that fails one time in ten can cost more than a slow one that never does. Look at the record, not just the speed."
msgstr "十次有一次出包的快管道，可能比從不出包的慢管道更貴。看的是紀錄，不只是速度。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A favorable quote is not the amount you receive: include the spread when planning cash."
msgstr "匯率換算結果不等於實際入帳金額；規劃現金時也要算入價差。"

#: data/economy/fundraising.json
msgid "A food group that wants one steady local supplier month after month."
msgstr "食品集團，希望每個月都有一家穩定的本地供應商。"

#: data/jobs/city_clerk.json
msgid "A food-truck owner needs four permits. You find the one form that covers all of them."
msgstr "一位餐車老闆需要四張許可證，你找到一張表格就能全部搞定。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "A foreign price is not a home-currency promise."
msgstr "外幣售價，並不保證本國幣實收金額。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "A foreign sale is not home cash."
msgstr "海外賣出去，不代表本國幣已入帳。"

#: data/dialogue/marcus_fx.json
msgid "A forward locks the sale of expected foreign receipts, not free money. You pay a fee and collateral; a stronger foreign currency means the hedge loses while your receipts gain. Repricing or future home-currency invoices are also choices."
msgstr "遠期合約鎖定預期外幣收入的賣出匯率，簽約要付手續費與保證金。外幣升值時，避險合約會虧損，但收入換回本國幣會增加。你也可以重新定價，或讓未來合約改用本國幣開票。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/insolvency_modal.gd:74
msgid "A fresh start"
msgstr "重新出發"

#: scripts/sim/phone_messages.gd:48
msgid "A friend is waiting. Visit when it suits you."
msgstr "朋友正在等你，有空再去見面。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A fuller van spreads the fixed time of a trip over more parcels, so each parcel costs less to deliver."
msgstr "貨車裝得越滿，每趟固定的時間就分攤到更多包裹上，每件的送貨成本就越低。"

#: data/events/hotel_review_storm.json
msgid "A guest's angry post is spreading across the booking platform."
msgstr "一位房客的怒文正在訂房平台上擴散。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A gym class can introduce a buyer, courier or local reporter. Each opportunity has terms you can accept or decline."
msgstr "健身課可能讓你認識買家、物流商或地方記者。每個機會都有條款，可接受或婉拒。"

#: data/events/fitness_carrier.json
msgid "A gym member introduces a courier with a seven-day trial price."
msgstr "一位健身會員介紹物流商，提供七天試用運價。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A hedge can lose when the foreign currency strengthens; it does not guarantee business profit."
msgstr "外幣升值時，避險可能虧損；避險也不保證公司獲利。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A high asking price can fail. Viewings still cost time and money."
msgstr "開價過高可能無法成交，帶看仍會花費時間與金錢。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A high price with empty rooms can earn less than a lower price that sells out."
msgstr "房價高但房間空著，可能賺得比較低價賣滿還少。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A higher rating brings more customers every day, for free."
msgstr "評分越高，每天自然來的客人就越多，不用多花錢。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A home carries a mortgage, management, maintenance and tax. A personal car adds insurance, fuel or charging and parking. Furniture changes appearance only."
msgstr "住宅有房貸、管理、維修與稅費，自用車另有保險、油錢或充電、停車費；家具只改變外觀。"

#: data/economy/settlement_methods.json
msgid "A licensed exchange turns your dollars into digital dollars and sends them in minutes. You carry the platform's risk."
msgstr "持牌交易所把你的錢換成數位美元，幾分鐘就送到。平台的風險由你承擔。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A listing needs photos. You can spend time shooting them or pay Studio Lumen for professional photos."
msgstr "上架需要照片，可以自己花時間拍攝，或付費請 Studio Lumen 拍專業照片。"

#: scripts/sim/global_market.gd:227
msgid "A live company and international account are required."
msgstr "需要營運中的公司及國際帳戶。"

#: data/events/fitness_press.json
msgid "A local sponsored report"
msgstr "地方贊助報導"

#: scripts/sim/hotel.gd:625
msgid "A locked group block uses these rooms during the renovation."
msgstr "已鎖定的團體房在翻新期間要用這些房間。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A longer term lowers the monthly burden but can increase total interest. Compare both before borrowing."
msgstr "較長期限可降低每月負擔，但總利息可能增加；借款前要一起比較。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A low minimum lets you test a product cheaply; big orders tie up more cash in stock."
msgstr "最低訂購量低，就能用小錢試賣新商品；訂得多，就有更多現金卡在庫存裡。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A low quote may lose money; a high quote loses the client."
msgstr "報價太低可能虧損；報價太高會失去客戶。"

#: data/events/media_client.json
msgid "A major client is thinking of leaving. Let them go and refund the unused advance, or offer a discount to keep the campaign."
msgstr "一位大客戶打算離開。你可以讓他們走並退還未使用的預付款，或提供折扣留住這個活動。"

#: data/events/automotive_recall.json
msgid "A maker has recalled a part used in some of your rental cars. Pull them from service for three days, or keep renting them and risk breakdowns."
msgstr "原廠召回了你部分租賃車使用的零件。可停駛三天處理，或繼續出租並承擔拋錨風險。"

#: data/story/goals.json
msgid "A market abroad"
msgstr "走進海外市場"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/creative_pitch.gd:15
msgid "A matching card earns the point. Waiting never lowers your score."
msgstr "選對卡片就得分，等再久也不會扣分。"

#: data/jobs/cowork_host.json
msgid "A member asks where to find cheap suppliers. You point them to Ken."
msgstr "有會員問哪裡找便宜的供應商，你介紹他去找 Ken。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A missed target lowers reputation and future brief opportunities."
msgstr "未達目標會降低聲譽及未來客戶需求機會。"

#: data/milestones.json
msgid "A month behind the counter"
msgstr "吧檯滿一個月"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A monthly premium that covers accidents, theft and damage to your van and what is in it."
msgstr "每月繳的保費，涵蓋貨車和車上貨物的意外、失竊和損壞。"

#: scripts/sim/housing.gd:49
msgid "A move is already booked. Keep it, cancel it or resolve the storage problem."
msgstr "搬家已預約。可以保留、取消，或先解決庫存容量問題。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A negative account can trigger warnings and insolvency. Review the forecast and reduce costs before more bills arrive."
msgstr "帳戶餘額為負可能觸發警告與破產流程；更多帳單到期前先看預測、降低支出。"

#: data/quests/green_showroom_launch.json
msgid "A new EV showroom wants cars on the floor, chargers and rooftop solar on site, and a launch campaign that fills it on opening weekend."
msgstr "新的電動車展間需要展示車、現場充電樁與屋頂太陽能，還要一場讓開幕週末客滿的宣傳活動。"

#: data/quests/new_neighbourhood_opening.json
msgid "A new block opens on Lot 7. The Trust wants it built, solar on the roofs and a sales campaign running before the keys are handed over."
msgstr "第 7 號地塊要開新社區。開發信託要求蓋好、屋頂裝上太陽能，並在交屋前跑完銷售活動。"

#: scripts/sim/world.gd:87
msgid "A new era in Aurelia: Year %d — %s."
msgstr "奧瑞莉亞進入新時代：第 %d 年——%s。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/legacy_mentor_modal.gd:12
msgid "A new founder at Nexus Co-work has enough cash for one batch. Discuss product pricing or inventory cash flow; either conversation takes one hour and pays no fee."
msgstr "Nexus Co-work 有一位新創辦人，手上的現金只夠買一批貨。你可以陪他討論定價或庫存現金流；交談都需一小時，不收取費用。"

#: scripts/sim/life_legacy.gd:121
msgid "A new life at difficulty %d, carrying %s home dollars. Previous save: slot %d."
msgstr "展開難度 %d 的新人生，帶入 %s 本國元資本。上一局保存在第 %d 槽。"

#: data/events/energy_rule.json
msgid "A new rule requires an accessible bay at every public charging station. Retrofit now, or apply for an exemption and risk fines."
msgstr "新規定要求每座公共充電站都要有無障礙車位。現在改建，或申請豁免但可能被罰款。"

#: scripts/sim/legacy_business.gd:268
msgid "A new start is still a story."
msgstr "重新開始，也是一段值得留下的故事。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A one-off cost you earn back slowly from sales. Count it before you sign."
msgstr "一次性的支出，要靠之後的營收慢慢賺回來。簽約前先把它算進去。"

#: data/help/glossary.json
msgid "A paid half-day service blocks that vehicle and restores its condition to ninety."
msgstr "付費保養會讓這台車停用半天，並恢復到九十點車況。"

#: data/story/achievements.json
msgid "A parcel arrived"
msgstr "包裹送到了"

#: scripts/ui/group_ui.gd:116
msgid "A part from a business you do not run, or cannot finish, can be subcontracted for a fee. Unfinished parts at the deadline pay nothing."
msgstr "你沒有經營或做不完的部分，可以付費轉包。截止時沒完成的部分不給報酬。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/fundraising_modal.gd:325
msgid "A partnership is a contract: the partner issues real jobs, pays after the job's terms, and takes a share of what it pays. An exclusive deal pays more but shuts out rivals of the same kind."
msgstr "合作是一份合約：夥伴會發出真實的工作，依工作條件付款，並抽取其中一部分分潤。獨家合約價格較高，但會排除同類對手。"

#: data/help/help.json
msgid "A payment stuck on the wire can be switched to a faster rail later: Company OS → Operations → Purchase orders → Speed up."
msgstr "卡在電匯的款項之後可以改用更快的方式：Company OS → 營運 → 採購單 → 加快。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "A payroll. You're somebody's boss now. That's terrifying. Proud of you."
