#: data/dialogue/omar_trade.json
msgid "I buy at wholesale and keep the customers. A warehouse leaves the customers and margin with you, but you fund sea freight, duty, storage and slow stock. A video call works if you cannot afford a flight."
msgstr "我按批發價買斷，客戶歸我。用海外倉，客戶和零售毛利歸你，但海運、關稅、倉租與滯銷都由你承擔。機票太貴的話，我們先視訊談。"

