msgstr "我可以操作機台，週薪 $1,100。先登記為雇主，再到產線排程雇用我。"

#: data/dialogue/mayor_green_civic.json
msgid "I favor charging infrastructure and green subsidies, with a higher business tax to fund them."
msgstr "我主張建置充電設施並補助綠能，財源則來自較高的營業稅負。"

#: data/dialogue/mayor_enterprise_civic.json
msgid "I favor lower business taxes and faster venue zoning, with smaller energy grants."
msgstr "我主張降低企業稅負並加快展館都市計畫審查，能源補助則會縮減。"

#: data/dialogue/omar_haddad_intro.json
msgid "I introduce suppliers and buyers across borders. Compare freight, duty, insurance and payment risk before accepting a trade; a good quote can still lose money."
msgstr "我替跨國供應商和買家牽線。接單前先比較運費、關稅、保險與收款風險；報價看來漂亮，仍可能虧錢。"

#: data/dialogue/elena_cameo.json
msgid "I invest in companies, not ideas. Register one and we'll talk."
msgstr "我投資公司，不投資點子。先登記一間公司再來談。"

#: data/dialogue/marcus_lending.json
msgid "I lend on cash flow and collateral: gross profit, money owed to you, signed contracts, stock."
msgstr "我看現金流和擔保品放款：毛利、應收帳款、已簽合約、庫存。"

