#: data/story/personal/lina.json
msgid "Lina Zhao asks for an import document checklist. Their evidence contains an unresolved question. What should the first draft do?"
msgstr "Lina Zhao 請你協助整理進口文件核對表，但資料有一項問題尚未釐清。初稿應該怎麼處理？"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "Lina Zhao has an offer for importers: talk to her at Nexus Bank (weekdays 10–16), or wait for her call"
msgstr "Lina Zhao 有個給進口商的提案：到 Nexus 銀行找她（平日 10–16 點），或等她來電"

#: data/story/personal/lina.json
msgid "Lina Zhao is ready to introduce a paying client for the import document checklist. The client asks for a promise you cannot verify. What do you put in the handover?"
msgstr "Lina Zhao 準備引薦願意付費的客戶，委託內容是進口文件核對表。客戶要求你做出無法驗證的承諾，交付資料應如何寫？"

#: data/dialogue/lina_intro.json
msgid "Lina Zhao. I run a cross-border payments startup; Nexus lets me hold office hours here. Let me guess: you paid a supplier abroad and the money hasn't landed."
msgstr "我是 Lina Zhao，經營一家跨境支付新創，Nexus 讓我在這裡駐點。我猜猜：你付款給國外供應商，錢還沒到。"

#: scripts/sim/rails.gd:206
msgid "Lina Zhao. The bridge under our rail was exploited: transfers are frozen until about %s. Nothing of yours was crossing it, so you're fine. Lumina Direct is taking wires only for now."
msgstr "我是 Lina Zhao。我們管道底下的跨鏈橋被駭了：轉帳凍結，預計 %s 前後恢復。你沒有款項正在經過它，所以沒事。Lumina Direct 暫時只收電匯。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "Lina Zhao. Volumes tripled since spring. Every importer I know is on the rails now. Enjoy the quiet."
msgstr "我是 Lina Zhao。從春天到現在交易量成長三倍，我認識的進口商都上軌道了。趁現在平靜，好好享受。"

#: data/story/chapters.json
msgid "Lina Zhao. We launched something for importers: escrow on delivery. It's optional. Come by Nexus Bank, weekdays 10 to 4, and I'll show you."
msgstr "我是 Lina Zhao。我們推出了給進口商的新東西：貨到放款託管，可用可不用。平日 10 點到 4 點來 Nexus 銀行，我帶你看。"

#: data/story/personal/lina.json
msgid "Lina Zhao: import document checklist · part 1"
msgstr "Lina Zhao：進口文件核對表・第 1 段"

#: data/story/personal/lina.json
msgid "Lina Zhao: import document checklist · part 2"
msgstr "Lina Zhao：進口文件核對表・第 2 段"

#: data/story/personal/lina.json
msgid "Lina Zhao: import document checklist · part 3"
msgstr "Lina Zhao：進口文件核對表・第 3 段"

