msgstr "✗ 請先上架商品。若公司無法交易，45 天後可檢討並結束本次擴張。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/tax_filing_modal.gd:55
msgid "✗ Documents need correction; fix them now or automatic correction charges a fee in 7 days."
msgstr "✗ 文件待補正；現在修正，或 7 天後付費自動補正。"

#: scripts/ui/real_estate_ui.gd:181
msgid "✗ Fund the next construction milestone."
msgstr "✗ 請備妥下一期工程款。"

#: scripts/sim/rivals.gd:250
msgid "✗ Insufficient company cash — save %s first."
msgstr "✗ 公司現金不足 — 先存下 %s。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/tax_filing_modal.gd:53
msgid "✗ Insufficient company cash; visit a terminal → Finance to fund the payment."
msgstr "✗ 公司現金不足；請到電腦 → 財務備妥稅款。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:280
msgid "✗ It doesn't fit. Rotate it or choose a free cell."
msgstr "✗ 放不下，請旋轉或換個空格。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:194
msgid "✗ It doesn't fit. Try a bigger box."
msgstr "✗ 裝不下，換大一點的箱子。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/life_review_modal.gd:32
msgid "✗ Live thirty days or finish the main story before retiring. Continue living this life."
msgstr "✗ 先生活三十天或完成主線，再選擇退休。目前可以繼續這段人生。"

#: scripts/ui/market_view.gd:10
msgid "✗ Market history is not initialized — enter the city to begin tracking."
msgstr "✗ 尚無市場紀錄 — 進入城市後開始追蹤。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/legacy_modal.gd:104
msgid "✗ No capitalized company to sell. Open a business account or choose another ending; no sale payment is made."
msgstr "✗ 目前沒有已開立公司帳戶的企業可出售。先開立帳戶或選其他結局；此時不會收到出售款。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/fitness_modal.gd:17
msgid "✗ No class pass — buy one at Rosa's reception."
msgstr "✗ 尚無課程資格——請到 Rosa 櫃台購買。"

#: scripts/ui/governance_ui.gd:44
msgid "✗ No cover; buy before a loss, then wait 7 days."
msgstr "✗ 尚無保障；請先投保，等待 7 天後才承保損失。"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:179
msgid "✗ No installs yet. Survey a roof and send a quote."
msgstr "✗ 還沒有安裝案。先勘查屋頂並送出報價。"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:99
msgid "✗ No roof leads this week. New leads arrive every Monday."
msgstr "✗ 本週沒有屋頂客戶。新客戶每週一出現。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/auction_game.gd:115
msgid "✗ No sale. Next step: check the other lots."
msgstr "✗ 沒有成交。下一步：看看其他拍賣車。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/tax_filing_modal.gd:41
msgid "✗ Not filed; choose a filing method below."
msgstr "✗ 尚未申報；請選擇下方申報方式。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/poach_modal.gd:25
msgid "✗ Offer expired — return to your team."
msgstr "✗ offer 已到期 — 返回團隊頁。"

#: scripts/ui/real_estate_ui.gd:193 scripts/ui/real_estate_ui.gd:94
msgid "✗ Own a rental and apply for the building permit at City Hall first."
msgstr "✗ 請先持有出租物件，再到市政廳申請建照。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/research_modal.gd:15
msgid "✗ Own or list a product — buy stock or create a listing first."
msgstr "✗ 尚無可調查商品——請先買進庫存或建立上架。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/parcel_sort_game.gd:51
msgid "✗ Parcel damaged: contents exposed. Record damage before moving it to the inspection shelf."
msgstr "✗ 包裹破損且內容外露，請登記損壞後移到檢查架。"

#: scripts/ui/energy_ui.gd:146
msgid "✗ Place at least one panel on the roof."
msgstr "✗ 請至少在屋頂放一片面板。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/teller_cash_game.gd:65
msgid "✗ Receipt missing — explain the return policy"
msgstr "✗ 缺少收據，請說明退貨規則"

#: scripts/ui/modals/overseas_partner_modal.gd:26
msgid "✗ Register a live company first. Closed-company deals cannot resume."
msgstr "✗ 請先成立仍在營運的公司。已關閉公司的交易無法恢復。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/tax_filing_modal.gd:20
msgid "✗ Register an open company first; visit City Hall's registration counter."
msgstr "✗ 請先成立營業中的公司；前往市政廳登記櫃檯。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/permits_modal.gd:24
msgid "✗ Registration counter · %s"
msgstr "✗ 到登記櫃台 · %s"

#: scripts/ui/manufacturing_ui.gd:140
msgid "✗ Rent a machine in OEM orders first."
msgstr "✗ 請先到代工單租用機台。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/company_os.gd:502
msgid "✗ Research expired — visit Crestline again."
msgstr "✗ 調查已過期——請再去 Crestline 調查。"

#: scripts/ui/media_ui.gd:134
msgid "✗ Select a running campaign to adjust media shares."
msgstr "✗ 請選擇進行中的活動，再調整媒體占比。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/pack_game.gd:184
msgid "✗ Select an item, rotate if needed, then click a free grid cell."
msgstr "✗ 請選商品，必要時旋轉，再點空格放入。"

#: scripts/ui/real_estate_ui.gd:143
msgid "✗ Select an owner mandate and a client, then arrange a viewing."
msgstr "✗ 請先選擇屋主委託及客戶，再安排帶看。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/capital_market_modal.gd:30
msgid "✗ This company is closed or replaced. Continue with your current life."
msgstr "✗ 這家公司已關閉或已被新公司取代，請繼續目前的人生。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/legal_case_modal.gd:13
msgid "✗ This company or dispute is closed; return to your current company's terminal."
msgstr "✗ 這家公司或爭議已關閉；請回到目前公司的電腦。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/barista_game.gd:74
msgid "✗ This table is occupied or dirty. Serve another guest or clean it."
msgstr "✗ 這桌有人或尚未清潔，請先服務其他客人或清潔。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/settings_modal.gd:124
msgid "✗ Turn on"
msgstr "✗ 開啟"

#: scripts/ui/modals/legal_case_modal.gd:18
msgid "✗ Unresolved; choose a route. No response by %s uses settlement automatically, including its fee and risks."
msgstr "✗ 尚未解決；請選擇處理方式。%s 前未回應會自動採用和解，仍須支付費用並承擔風險。"

#: scripts/ui/modals/settings_modal.gd:141
msgid "✗ Used by %s. Choose another key."
msgstr "✗ 已用於「%s」，請改用其他按鍵。"

#: scripts/ui/minigames/barista_game.gd:107
msgid "✗ Wrong table. Recover the order and clean up."
msgstr "✗ 送錯桌了，請重新確認並清潔。"
